( F4 T4 / K20: axisymmetric quad4 patch [4x4 quad4, r 1..2, z 0..1,
  E 1000, nu 0.3] with a point load -1 in y at the top outer corner.
  The quad4 is integrated with 2x2 Gauss, as the Professional 02-08-2026
  does: post_point 1 disx 2.657533803232e-04, disy -4.380511327008e-04
  [= Professional to 1e-14]. Old GNU: forced 1-point rule, hourglass
  modes free, disy ~1e12. )
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 2
materi_velocity
materi_displacement
materi_stress
end_initia
node 1 1 0
